# MODUAL LOCAL LEARNING LOG

Minimal durable episode:
- node stable ID;
- cue/raw pointer;
- extracted feature summary when needed;
- event/consequence pointer;
- temporal relation/window;
- changed local parameter names and deltas;
- action/readback pointer;
- source/time/revision provenance.

Do not persist hidden reasoning as a feature or training target.
Do not infer a biological Hebbian/STDP rule from a software parameter delta.


